cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Data Washing Machine (Classic)"
message: >-
  Cite the upstream Data Washing Machine refactor and this fork if you use this
  software. The Bitbucket project is the authoritative source for the original
  codebase; this repository adds data capture, reporting, and metrics extensions.
authors:
  - name: "Taha Mohammed"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaTaha-ualr/DataWashingMachineClassic"
license-url: "https://github.com/MaTaha-ualr/DataWashingMachineClassic/blob/main/LICENSE"
date-released: "2026-03-30"
abstract: >-
  Fork of dwm-refactor-v1 with added run-level data capture (CSV/JSON under
  data_capture/), truth-aware exports, per-iteration blocking metrics, and
  input-basenamed log/Excel outputs. Original DWM: Bitbucket oysterer/dwm-refactor-v1.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "dwm-refactor-v1 (Data Washing Machine refactor)"
    repository-code: "https://bitbucket.org/oysterer/dwm-refactor-v1"
    abstract: "Upstream Python refactor of the Data Washing Machine; cite as the original implementation."
